## Frequently asked questions

**Do you only work with Caerphilly businesses?**

No. We work with businesses across South Wales and the UK.

**How much does a website cost?**

One-page WordPress websites start from £199. Larger custom small business websites are quoted based on the number of pages and features required. We offer fixed-price packages with no hidden costs — [get in touch](/contact/) for a free quote.

**Can you help improve my Google rankings?**

Yes. Every website is SEO-ready from day one. We also offer [local SEO campaigns](/services/local-seo-google-ranking/).

**How long does a website take?**

Most projects are completed within 7–14 days.

**Will my website work on mobile?**

Yes. Every website we build uses mobile-first design.

**Can I update the site myself?**

Yes. We provide full access and training as part of every project.

